# Customer Portal Rules

- React Native + TypeScript; targets iOS, Android and Web.
- TypeScript strict mode must remain enabled.
- Follow the existing feature-module/navigation architecture.
- Reuse shared Button/Input/Card/Loader/Empty/Error primitives.
- Secure tokens through the token-storage abstraction only.
- Never put secrets in the client.
- Never trust client price, discount, stock, payment or refund values.
- Implement loading, empty, validation, error, retry and stale-data states when relevant.
- Keep iOS, Android and Web behavior aligned unless the sprint explicitly defines platform-specific behavior.
- Add component/unit tests for new behavior.
